# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code. The anon key is
# meant to be public (safe in a browser bundle) — it can only do what your
# Supabase project's RLS policies and auth rules allow. Copy to .env and
# fill in from the same Supabase project as the server's SUPABASE_URL.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
